        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: N. T. Rama Rao, Vishwamitra\n- Works: Brahmarshi Vishwamitra\n- Organizations: NTR Charity Trust\n- Roles: actor, filmmaker, director, editor, politician, Chief Minister of Andhra Pradesh\n\nFacts:\n- Nandamuri Taraka Rama Rao was born on 28 May 1923 and died on 18 January 1996.\n- Nandamuri Taraka Rama Rao was popularly known as NTR.\n- Nandamuri Taraka Rama Rao was an Indian actor, filmmaker, director, editor, and politician.\n- Nandamuri Taraka Rama Rao served as Chief Minister of Andhra Pradesh for seven years across three terms.\n- Brahmarshi Vishwamitra is a 1991 Telugu hagiographical film.\n- Brahmarshi Vishwamitra was produced and directed by N. T. Rama Rao.\n- Brahmarshi Vishwamitra was made under the NTR Charity Trust banner.",
